\newlabel{tab:taxonomy}{{1}{7}{Bias under $K{=}3$ non-differential misclassification (100{,}000 Dirichlet$(1,1,1)$ matrices). Violation: $|\text {bias}| > 0$; Sign Flip: any coefficient reverses sign; Amplif.: $|\hat {\tau }| > |\tau |$. $\tau _{\text {sf}}{=}0$?: sign-flip guarantee holds unconditionally (Yes), conditionally (Cond.; Proposition~\ref {prop:signflip}), or not (No). Collider 100\% amplification reflects Berkson bias---misclassification is protective}{table.caption.21}{}}
