\@writefile{lot}{\contentsline {table}{\numberline {26}{\ignorespaces Y-stratified non-differential test. Content-independent Y (text length) shows no significant violation (1/12 rejection $\approx $ expected false positive rate at $\alpha {=}0.05$). Content-dependent proxies (topic, sentiment) show expected violations since LLMs observe text content.}}{37}{table.caption.106}\protected@file@percent }
